{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:an-kla:schema:remember-result:v3",
  "title": "AN-KLA Remember Result v3",
  "description": "Resultado de `remember` (ADR-0063 D1). `state`: `committed` (con `revision`, salvo `already_committed: true` de un reintento sin lote propio), `rejected` (con `code` y `reason_codes`) o `queued` (la entrada está en la bandeja; con `drain_error` si el vaciado abortó con resultado conocido, con `outcome: unknown` si el commit quedó sin resultado firme —lo resuelve el paso 0 del vaciado siguiente—, y con `resolution: pending` cuando se pidió `--supersedes`: la resolución propia/ajena ocurre al vaciar). `record_id` sólo con `committed` y `queued` (un rechazado no crea record). `disputed` o `superseded` sólo con `committed` (D3). `rejected` lista todos los rechazos que produjo el vaciado de esta invocación, también los de otras entradas. Reintentar con el mismo texto, `kind` y target es idempotente. `--idempotency-key` acepta texto libre de 1 a 256 caracteres: `sha256:<64 hex>` se usa tal cual y cualquier otro valor se convierte en `sha256:` + sha256 de su UTF-8; `idempotency_key` es siempre la forma final. Sólo nombres y códigos: nunca el texto del recuerdo ni rutas. ADR-0065: un `state` lleva `slot` y jubila sólo la cabeza de su casilla: `retired` ({id, writer, enqueued_at}) dice a quién, `retired_by` (también con `already_committed`) qué `state` posterior lo jubiló a él y `conflict_remaining` los demás vigentes de la casilla (sólo por `plan-write`, restauración o `relocate`). Un `state` en cola no anuncia `record_id` (su id depende de la cabeza que jubila) y queda con `resolution: pending`. Rechazos propios: `remember_state_over_fact` y `remember_state_slot_mismatch`. ADR-0066: con anclas, `anchors` lleva por cada una las tres comprobaciones que hizo `remember` al encolar (nunca se vuelven a hacer al vaciar), y `coverage`, `missing` y `missing_total` la cobertura determinista del texto contra la cita guardada (sólo `none` se sirve como aviso; el registro siempre se guarda). `verdict` sólo en `dispute`. Rechazos de ancla (`anchor_*`, `dispute_*`) salen sin entrada y sin cambio en el store. ADR-0070: con `fact-checks-rules/v2` la cobertura dice sus `rules` y `missing` admite `hash` y `date`; sin `rules` es v1. ADR-0071: un `document` de `memoria/ancla/v2` se comprueba al escribir y al auditar, y al leer se sirve lo guardado: su resultado lleva `checked_at`, `manifest_sha256`, `derivation` y `custody`; sin resultado guardado, `not_checked`. ADR-0072 §4: v3 es disperso (v1 y v2 están publicados): sólo sale si la respuesta lleva el ámbito o la vigencia guardados (`subject`, `audience`, `valid_until` normalizada y `valid_until_input` tal como se dio, `until_revoked`, `revokes`) o `subject_normalized_from` (un `--subject` que sólo difería por mayúsculas, guardado en minúsculas).",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema",
    "untrusted_memory_data",
    "state",
    "entry",
    "kind",
    "idempotency_key",
    "enqueued_at",
    "outcome",
    "warnings",
    "rejected"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema": {
      "const": "an-kla/remember-result-v3"
    },
    "untrusted_memory_data": {
      "const": true
    },
    "state": {
      "enum": [
        "committed",
        "rejected",
        "queued"
      ]
    },
    "entry": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "kind": {
      "enum": [
        "fact",
        "decision",
        "state",
        "directive"
      ]
    },
    "idempotency_key": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}(?![\\s\\S])"
    },
    "enqueued_at": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}\\.[0-9]{6}Z(?![\\s\\S])"
    },
    "outcome": {
      "enum": [
        "known",
        "unknown"
      ]
    },
    "record_id": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "revision": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}(?![\\s\\S])"
    },
    "stream": {
      "enum": [
        "facts",
        "events",
        "episodes"
      ]
    },
    "operation": {
      "enum": [
        "add",
        "supersede"
      ]
    },
    "already_committed": {
      "const": true
    },
    "disputed": {
      "type": "object"
    },
    "superseded": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "code": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_:.-]{1,80}(?![\\s\\S])"
    },
    "reason_codes": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_:.-]{1,80}(?![\\s\\S])"
      }
    },
    "drain_error": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_:.-]{1,80}(?![\\s\\S])"
    },
    "resolution": {
      "const": "pending"
    },
    "warnings": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "rejected": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "count",
        "entries"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "count": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "entries": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "entry",
              "rejected_as",
              "code",
              "reason_codes"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "entry": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "rejected_as": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_:.-]{1,80}(?![\\s\\S])"
              },
              "reason_codes": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_:.-]{1,80}(?![\\s\\S])"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "slot": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]{0,31}(?![\\s\\S])"
    },
    "retired": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "id",
        "writer",
        "enqueued_at"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "writer": {
          "type": "object"
        },
        "enqueued_at": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "retired_by": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "conflict_remaining": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "anchors": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "index",
          "kind",
          "quote_sha256",
          "source",
          "source_reason",
          "quote",
          "quote_reason",
          "integrity",
          "integrity_reason",
          "match",
          "matched_text",
          "freshness",
          "reason"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "index": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "kind": {
            "enum": [
              "repo-file",
              "conversation",
              "document"
            ]
          },
          "quote_sha256": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "source": {
            "enum": [
              "verified",
              "not_found",
              "unverifiable"
            ]
          },
          "source_reason": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "enum": [
              null,
              "adapter_error",
              "anchor_limit",
              "commit_not_in_clone",
              "commit_not_on_default_branch",
              "copy_missing",
              "custodian_offline",
              "document_unknown",
              "kind_not_supported",
              "no_adapter",
              "no_default_branch",
              "no_git",
              "no_verifier",
              "not_checked",
              "path_missing",
              "repo_unavailable",
              "resolution_pending",
              "session_lacks_quote",
              "turn_purged"
            ]
          },
          "quote": {
            "enum": [
              "verified",
              "not_found",
              "unverifiable"
            ]
          },
          "quote_reason": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "enum": [
              null,
              "adapter_truncated",
              "anchor_limit",
              "binary",
              "commit_not_in_clone",
              "commit_not_on_default_branch",
              "custodian_offline",
              "derived_modality",
              "document_unknown",
              "integrity_not_verified",
              "kind_not_supported",
              "locator_invalid",
              "locator_not_found",
              "not_checked",
              "not_utf8",
              "quote_absent",
              "source_not_verified",
              "too_large"
            ]
          },
          "integrity": {
            "enum": [
              "verified",
              "not_found",
              "unverifiable"
            ]
          },
          "integrity_reason": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "enum": [
              null,
              "adapter_error",
              "anchor_limit",
              "binary",
              "commit_blob_lacks_quote",
              "commit_not_in_clone",
              "copy_sha_mismatch",
              "custodian_offline",
              "derivation_parent_mismatch",
              "derivation_superseded",
              "derivation_unsupported",
              "document_unknown",
              "kind_not_supported",
              "manifest_mismatch",
              "manifest_missing",
              "no_adapter",
              "no_verifier",
              "not_checked",
              "not_utf8",
              "raw_lost",
              "resolution_pending",
              "seal_mismatch",
              "session_lacks_quote",
              "source_not_verified",
              "too_large",
              "turn_purged",
              "working_tree"
            ]
          },
          "at": {
            "enum": [
              "default",
              "branch",
              "commit",
              "worktree",
              null
            ]
          },
          "match": {
            "enum": [
              "literal",
              "ws-nfc/v1",
              "ws-nfc-accents/v1",
              null
            ]
          },
          "matched_text": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "freshness": {
            "enum": [
              "broken",
              "stale",
              "unverified",
              "pending",
              "fresh"
            ]
          },
          "reason": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "resolution": {
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "resolved",
              "not_found"
            ]
          },
          "turn_id": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "checked_at": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Cuándo se comprobó (ADR-0071): la fecha del resultado guardado; null en un ancla v2 aún no comprobada."
          },
          "manifest_sha256": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "derivation": {
            "enum": [
              null,
              "current",
              "superseded",
              "unsupported"
            ],
            "description": "Estado de la derivación según el custodio al comprobar; null sin respuesta."
          },
          "custody": {
            "type": [
              "object",
              "null"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "retention": {
                "enum": [
                  "effective",
                  "expired",
                  "unknown"
                ]
              }
            },
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "adapter_called": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Sólo al escribir y al auditar: si se lanzó el adaptador."
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    },
    "coverage": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "total",
        "present",
        "level"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "total": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "present": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "level": {
          "enum": [
            "none",
            "partial",
            "full",
            "unchecked"
          ]
        },
        "rules": {
          "const": "fact-checks-rules/v2"
        }
      }
    },
    "missing": {
      "type": "array",
      "maxItems": 8,
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "value"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "enum": [
              "identifier",
              "path",
              "hash",
              "version",
              "date",
              "number"
            ]
          },
          "value": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "missing_total": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 0
    },
    "verdict": {
      "enum": [
        "contradicted",
        "insufficient"
      ]
    },
    "custodians_config_error": {
      "enum": [
        "custodians_unreadable",
        "custodians_invalid_json",
        "custodians_invalid_shape"
      ],
      "description": "ADR-0071 §3: la tabla de custodios no se pudo leer; todo custodio da adapter_error sin lanzar ningún proceso."
    },
    "subject": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "audience": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "valid_until": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "valid_until_input": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "until_revoked": {
      "const": true
    },
    "revokes": {
      "const": true
    },
    "subject_normalized_from": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Lo dado, cuando sólo difería de un repo.id canónico por mayúsculas."
    }
  },
  "allOf": [
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "state": {
            "const": "committed"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "record_id"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "state": {
            "const": "rejected"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "code",
          "reason_codes"
        ],
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "record_id"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
